  "schema:name": "Longitudinal Patient Record & Care Pathway",
  "schema:description": "Longitudinal Patient Record & Care Pathway:\r\nA single, integrated care coordination timeline covering preventive, acute, chronic, and rehabilitative care.\r\nPatient- and provider-facing long-term care plans with milestones, goals, and monitoring indicators.\r\nImproved continuity of care metrics (e.g., fewer dropouts, adherence to chronic care guidelines).\r\nSystem-level outputs for population health analytics: care continuity index, chronic disease control rates, preventive care uptake.",
  "schema:category": "Business",
